OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murdering Darlington
OL,4,Acare worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied murdering a woman who
OL,7,Fwas a care worker.
OL,9,FAndrew Bell, 44, from Richmond in North
OL,10,FYorkshire, appeared at Teesside Crown
OL,11,FCourt where he entered a not guilty
OL,12,Fplea to the charge of murdering Leanne
OL,13,FPark.
OL,15,FDurham Police were called to an address
OL,16,Fin Parkgate, Darlington, on the evening
OL,17,Fof 23 September where 44-year-old
OL,18,FPark's body was found.
OL,20,FBell was remanded in custody for a
OL,21,Ftrial on 8 March 2027.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
